      "created_at": "2017-10-06T06:14:26Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-10-06T06:14:26Z",
      "body": "@HHCHunter I know that people are sensitive about telemetry - so am I.\r\nBut in qBittorrent I would simply aim for functions and whatnot. No one would ever collect what you download, what you search for, or anything sensitive. It would be useful to see however how often do people use functions. If there is a decision to be made later on - that something just eats too many hours to maintain and develop - and no one uses it - it could be removed. That is just one use case though. \r\n",
