      "created_at": "2017-10-07T13:52:56Z",
      "updated_at": "2017-10-07T13:52:56Z",
      "body": "Haha, Seeker, we are not trying to collect _that_ sort of data. The main aim here is nothing of that sort, but to collect data on what people use in the client for example. Nothing that is personal, nothing that could be ever used for anything. The code will be open, maybe the data too (even though it will be useless for 99.9% of the people except for the devs.). So, no worries.",
