      "updated_at": "2017-10-08T12:42:37Z",
      "body": "You mean the settings in qBitTorrent not the torrents used *IN* qBitTorrent. (Your last post's wording is seriously not clear, I had to re-read the whole thread to gather that.)\r\n\r\nThe devs are overworked enough as it is at the moment, so this is at best a long-term project unless you're the one doing it!\r\n\r\nIt's exasperating, but the stack traces sometimes generated by qBitTorrent's crashes are barely usable by the devs as it is...so if anything needs to be improved in telemetry, it's THEM.",
